  "text": "## Risk Appetite by Category  \n### 1. Credit Risk  \n**Appetite:** Conservative  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **Loan Loss Ratio:** <0.5% annually\n- **Delinquency Rate:** <2% of active accounts\n- **Concentration:** No single customer >10% of capital\n- **Mortgage LTV:** <80% (maximum)  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank focuses on consumer lending (mortgages) with strong underwriting. Does not pursue commercial lending or risky credit products.  \n**Controls:**\n- Credit scoring mandatory for mortgages\n- Affordability assessment per FCA rules\n- Arrears management and escalation procedures\n- Regular loan quality reviews  \n---",
